{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1872,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"人がゐたにしても、どうせ死人ばかりである。下人","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1896,"width":368,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"は、そこで腰にさげた聖柄の太刀が鞘走らないやうに","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1920,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"氣をつけながら、藁草履をはいた足を、その梯子の一","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1944,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"番下の段へふみかけた。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1968,"width":176,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":1992,"width":390,"height":312},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"それから、何分かの後である。羅生門の樓の上へ出","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1992,"width":368,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"る、幅の廣い梯子の中段に、一人の男が、猫のやうに","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2016,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"身をちゞめて、息を殺しながら、上の容子を窺つてゐ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2040,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"た。樓の上からさす火の光が、かすかに、その男の右","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2064,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"の頰をぬらしてゐる。短い鬚の中に、赤く膿を持つた","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2088,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"面皰のある頰である。下人は、始めから、この上にゐ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2112,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"る者は、死人ばかりだと高を括つてゐた。それが、梯","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2136,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"子を二三段上つて見ると、上では誰か火をとぼして、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2160,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"しかもその火を其處此處と動かしてゐるらしい。これ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2184,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"は、その濁つた、黃いろい光が、隅々に蜘蛛の巢をか","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2208,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"けた天井裏に、ゆれながら映つたので、すぐにそれと","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2232,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"知れたのである。この雨の夜に、この羅生門の上で、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2256,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"火をともしてゐるからは、どうせ唯の者ではない。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2280,"width":368,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":2304,"width":390,"height":96},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"下人は、守宮のやうに足音をぬすんで、やつと急な梯","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2304,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"子を、一番上の段まで這ふやうにして上りつめた。さ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2328,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"うして體を出來る丈、平にしながら、頸を出來る丈、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2352,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"前へ出して、恐る恐る、樓の內を覗いて見た。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2376,"width":336,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":2400,"width":390,"height":312},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"見ると、樓の內には、噂に聞いた通り、幾つかの屍骸","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2400,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"が、無造作に棄てゝあるが、火の光の及ぶ範圍が、思","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2424,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"つたより狹いので、數は幾つともわからない。唯、お","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2448,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ぼろげながら、知れるのは、その中に裸の屍骸と、着","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2472,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"物を着た屍骸とがあると云ふ事である。勿論、中には","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2496,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"女も男もまじつてゐるらしい。さうして、その屍骸は","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2520,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"皆、それが、甞、生きてゐた人間だと云ふ事實さへ疑","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2544,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"はれる程、土を捏ねて造つた人形のやうに、口を開い","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2568,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"たり手を延ばしたりしてごろごろ床の上にころがつて","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2592,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ゐた。しかも、肩とか胸とかの高くなつてゐる部分","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2616,"width":368,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"に、ぼんやりした火の光をうけて、低くなつてゐる部","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2640,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"分の影を一層暗くしながら、永久に啞の如く默つてい","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2664,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"た。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2688,"width":32,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":2712,"width":390,"height":96},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"下人は、それらの屍骸の腐爛した臭氣に思はず、鼻を","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2712,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"掩つた。しかし、その手は、次の瞬間には、もう鼻を","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2736,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"掩ふ事を忘れてゐた。或る强い感情が、殆悉この男の","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2760,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"嗅覺を奪つてしまつたからである。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2784,"width":256,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":2808,"width":390,"height":144},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"下人の眼は、その時、はじめて、其屍骸の中に蹲つて","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2808,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"いる人間を見た。檜肌色の着物を著た、背の低い、瘦","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2832,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"せた、白髮頭の、猿のやうな老婆である。その老婆","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2856,"width":368,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"は、右の手に火をともした松の木片を持つて、その屍","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2880,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"骸の一つの顏を覗きこむやうに眺めてゐた。髮の毛の","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2904,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"長い所を見ると、多分女の屍骸であらう。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2928,"width":304,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":2952,"width":390,"height":192},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"下人は、六分の恐怖と四分の好奇心とに動かされて、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2952,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"暫時は呼吸をするのさへ忘れてゐた。舊記の記者の語","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2976,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"を借りれば、「頭身の毛も太る」やうに感じたのであ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3000,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"る。すると、老婆は、松の木片を、床板の間に挿し","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3024,"width":368,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"て、それから、今まで眺めてゐた屍骸の首に兩手をか","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3048,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"けると、丁度、猿の親が猿の子の虱をとるやうに、そ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3072,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"の長い髮の毛を一本づゝ拔きはじめた。髮は手に從つ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3096,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"て拔けるらしい。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3120,"width":128,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":3144,"width":390,"height":288},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"その髮の毛が、一本ずゝ拔けるのに從つて下人の心か","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3144,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"らは、恐怖が少しづつ消えて行つた。さうして、それ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3168,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"と同時に、この老婆に對するはげしい憎惡が、少し","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3192,"width":368,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"づゝ動いて來た。――いや、この老婆に對すると云つ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3216,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ては、語弊があるかも知れない。寧、あらゆる惡に對","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3240,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"する反感が、一分每に强さを增して來たのである。こ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3264,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"の時、誰かがこの下人に、さつき門の下でこの男が考","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3288,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"へてゐた、饑死をするか盜人になるかと云ふ問題を、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3312,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"改めて持出したら、恐らく下人は、何の未練もなく、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3336,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"饑死を選んだ事であらう。それほど、この男の惡を憎","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3360,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"む心は、老婆の床に挿した松の木片のやうに、勢よく","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3384,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"燃え上り出してゐたのである。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3408,"width":224,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":3432,"width":390,"height":168},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"下人には、勿論、何故老婆が死人の髮の毛を拔くかわ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3432,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"からなかつた。從つて、合理的には、それを善惡の何","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3456,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"れに片づけてよいか知らなかつた。しかし下人にとつ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3480,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ては、この雨の夜に、この羅生門の上で、死人の髮の","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3504,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"毛を拔くと云ふ事が、それ丈で既に許す可らざる惡で","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3528,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"あつた。勿論、下人は、さつき迄自分が、盜人になる","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3552,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"氣でゐた事なぞは、とうに忘れてゐるのである。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3576,"width":352,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":3600,"width":390,"height":96},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"そこで、下人は、兩足に力を入れて、いきなり、梯子","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3600,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"から上へ飛び上つた。さうして聖柄の太刀に手をかけ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3624,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ながら、大股に老婆の前へ步みよつた。老婆が驚いた","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3648,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"のは、云ふ迄もない。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3672,"width":160,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":3696,"width":390,"height":48},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"老婆は、一目下人を見ると、まるで弩にでも彈かれた","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3696,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"やうに、飛び上つた。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3720,"width":160,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":3744,"width":390,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"「おのれ、どこへ行く。」","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3744,"width":192,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":3768,"width":390,"height":192},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"下人は、老婆が屍骸につまづきながら、慌てふためい","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3768,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"て逃げようとする行手を塞いで、こう罵つた。老婆","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3792,"width":368,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"は、それでも下人をつきのけて行かうとする。下人は","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3816,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"又、それを行かすまいとして、押しもどす。二人は屍","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3840,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"骸の中で、暫、無言のまゝ、つかみ合つた。しかし勝","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3864,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"敗は、はじめから、わかつている。下人はとうとう、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3888,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"老婆の腕をつかんで、無理にそこへ扭ぢ倒した。丁","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3912,"width":368,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"度、鷄の脚のやうな、骨と皮ばかりの腕である。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3936,"width":352,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":3960,"width":390,"height":48},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"「何をしてゐた。さあ何をしてゐた。云へ。云はぬ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3960,"width":368,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"と、これだぞよ。」","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3984,"width":144,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":4008,"width":390,"height":312},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"下人は、老婆をつき放すと、いきなり、太刀の鞘を拂","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4008,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"つて、白い鋼の色をその眼の前へつきつけた。けれど","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4032,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"も、老婆は默つてゐる。兩手をわなわなふるはせて、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4056,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"肩で息を切りながら、眼を、眼球が眶の外へ出さうに","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4080,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"なる程、見開いて、啞のやうに執拗く默つてゐる。こ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4104,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"れを見ると、下人は始めて明白にこの老婆の生死が、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4128,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"全然、自分の意志に支配されてゐると云ふ事を意識し","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4152,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"た。さうして、この意識は、今まではげしく燃えてゐ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4176,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"た憎惡の心を何時の間にか冷ましてしまつた。後に殘","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4200,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"つたのは、唯、或仕事をして、それが圓滿に成就した","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4224,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"時の、安らかな得意と滿足とがあるばかりである。そ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4248,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"こで、下人は、老婆を見下しながら、少し聲を柔げて","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4272,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"かう云つた。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4296,"width":96,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":4320,"width":390,"height":120},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"「己は檢非違使の廳の役人などではない。今し方この","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4320,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"門の下を通りかゝつた旅の者だ。だからお前に繩をか","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4344,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"けて、どうしようと云ふやうな事はない。唯、今時","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4368,"width":368,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"分、この門の上で、何をして居たのだか、それを己に","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4392,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"話しさへすればいいのだ。」","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4416,"width":208,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":4440,"width":390,"height":168},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"すると、老婆は、見開いてゐた眼を、一層大きくし","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4440,"width":368,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"て、ぢつとその下人の顏を見守つた。眶の赤くなつ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4464,"width":368,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"た、肉食鳥のやうな、銳い眼で見たのである。それか","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4488,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ら、皺で、殆、鼻と一つになつた唇を、何か物でも嚙","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4512,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"んでゐるやうに動かした。細い喉で、尖つた喉佛の動","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4536,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"いてゐるのが見える。その時、その喉から、鴉の啼く","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4560,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"やうな聲が、喘ぎ喘ぎ、下人の耳へ傳はつて來た。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4584,"width":368,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":4608,"width":390,"height":48},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"「この髮を拔いてな、この女の髮を拔いてな、鬘にせ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4608,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"うと思うたのぢや。」","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4632,"width":160,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":4656,"width":390,"height":168},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"下人は、老婆の答が存外、平凡なのに失望した。さう","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4656,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"して失望すると同時に、又前の憎惡が、冷な侮蔑と一","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4680,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"しよに、心の中へはいつて來た。すると、その氣色","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4704,"width":368,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"が、先方へも通じたのであらう。老婆は、片手に、ま","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4728,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"だ屍骸の頭から奪つた長い拔け毛を持つたなり、蟇の","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4752,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"つぶやくやうな聲で、口ごもりながら、こんな事を云","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4776,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"つた。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4800,"width":48,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":4824,"width":390,"height":408},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"成程、死人の髮の毛を拔くと云ふ事は、惡い事かも知","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4824,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"れぬ。しかし、かう云ふ死人の多くは、皆、その位な","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4848,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"事を、されてもいゝ人間ばかりである。現に、自分が","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4872,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"今、髮を拔いた女などは、蛇を四寸ばかりづゝに切つ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4896,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"て干したのを、干魚だと云つて、太刀帶の陣へ賣りに","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4920,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"行つた。疫病にかゝつて死ななかつたなら、今でも賣","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4944,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"りに行つてゐたかもしれない。しかも、この女の賣る","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4968,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"干魚は、味がよいと云ふので、太刀帶たちが、缺かさ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4992,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ず菜料に買つてゐたのである。自分は、この女のした","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5016,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"事が惡いとは思はない。しなければ、饑死をするの","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5040,"width":368,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"で、仕方がなくした事だからである。だから、又今、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5064,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"自分のしてゐた事も惡い事とは思はない。これもやは","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5088,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"りしなければ、饑死をするので、仕方がなくする事だ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5112,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"からである。さうして、その仕方がない事を、よく知","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5136,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"つてゐたこの女は、自分のする事を許してくれるのに","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5160,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ちがひないと思ふからである。――老婆は、大體こん","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5184,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"な意味の事を云つた。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5208,"width":160,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":5232,"width":390,"height":312},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"下人は、太刀を鞘におさめて、その太刀の柄を左の手","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5232,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"でおさへながら、冷然として、この話を聞いてゐた。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5256,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"勿論、右の手では、赤く頰に膿を持つた大きな面皰を","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5280,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"氣にしながら、聞いてゐるのである。しかし、之を聞","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5304,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"いてゐる中に、下人の心には、或勇氣が生まれて來","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5328,"width":368,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"た。それは、さつき、門の下でこの男に缺けてゐた勇","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5352,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"氣である。さうして、又さつき、この門の上へ上つ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5376,"width":368,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"て、この老婆を捕へた時の勇氣とは、全然、反對な方","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5400,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"向に動かうとする勇氣である。下人は、饑死をするか","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5424,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"盜人になるかに迷はなかつたばかりではない。その時","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5448,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"のこの男の心もちから云へば、饑死などと云ふ事は、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5472,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"殆、考へる事さへ出來ない程、意識の外に追ひ出され","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5496,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"てゐた。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5520,"width":64,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":5544,"width":390,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"「きつと、そうか。」","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5544,"width":160,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":5568,"width":390,"height":96},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"老婆の話が完ると、下人は嘲るやうな聲で念を押し","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5568,"width":368,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"た。さうして、一足前へ出ると、不意に、右の手を面","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5592,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"皰から離して、老婆の襟上をつかみながら、かう云つ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5616,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"た。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5640,"width":32,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":5664,"width":390,"height":48},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"「では、己が引剝をしようと恨むまいな。己もさうし","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5664,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"なければ、饑死をする體なのだ。」","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5688,"width":256,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":5712,"width":390,"height":144},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"下人は、すばやく、老婆の着物を剝ぎとつた。それか","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5712,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ら、足にしがみつかうとする老婆を、手荒く屍骸の上","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5736,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"へ蹴倒した。梯子の口までは、僅に五步を數へるばか","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5760,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"りである。下人は、剝ぎとつた檜肌色の着物をわきに","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5784,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"かゝへて、またゝく間に急な梯子を夜の底へかけ下り","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5808,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"た。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5832,"width":32,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":5856,"width":390,"height":168},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"暫、死んだやうに倒れてゐた老婆が、屍骸の中から、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5856,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"その裸の體を起したのは、それから間もなくの事であ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5880,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"る。老婆は、つぶやくやうな、うめくやうな聲を立て","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5904,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ながら、まだ燃えてゐる火の光をたよりに、梯子の口","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5928,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"まで、這つて行つた。さうして、そこから、短い白髮","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5952,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"を倒にして、門の下を覗きこんだ。外には、唯、黑","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5976,"width":368,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"洞々たる夜があるばかりである。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":6000,"width":240,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":6024,"width":390,"height":48},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"下人は、既に、雨を冐して、京都の町へ强盜を働きに","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":6024,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"急いでゐた。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":6048,"width":96,"height":24}]}}]}]}]}]}}